स्वल्पमप्यस्य धर्मस्य त्रायते महतो भयात् ॥ ४० ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":744,\"bb\":670,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/2/40/b670/\",\"body_value\":\"nehābhikrama-nāśo ’sti
pratyavāyo na vidyate
sv-alpam apy asya dharmasya
trāyate mahato bhayāt\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":745,\"bb\":671,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/2/40/b671/\",\"shadow_value\":\"na – there is not; iha – in this yoga; abhikrama – in endeavoring; nāśaḥ – loss; asti – there is; pratyavāyaḥ – diminution; na – never; vidyate – there is; su-alpam – a little; api – although; asya – of this; dharmasya – occupation; trāyate – releases; mahataḥ – from very great; bhayāt – danger.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"na\",\"translation\":\"there is not\"},{\"word\":\"iha\",\"translation\":\"in this yoga\"},{\"word\":\"abhikrama\",\"translation\":\"in endeavoring\"},{\"word\":\"nāśaḥ\",\"translation\":\"loss\"},{\"word\":\"asti\",\"translation\":\"there is\"},{\"word\":\"pratyavāyaḥ\",\"translation\":\"diminution\"},{\"word\":\"na\",\"translation\":\"never\"},{\"word\":\"vidyate\",\"translation\":\"there is\"},{\"word\":\"su-alpam\",\"translation\":\"a little\"},{\"word\":\"api\",\"translation\":\"although\"},{\"word\":\"asya\",\"translation\":\"of this\"},{\"word\":\"dharmasya\",\"translation\":\"occupation\"},{\"word\":\"trāyate\",\"translation\":\"releases\"},{\"word\":\"mahataḥ\",\"translation\":\"from very great\"},{\"word\":\"bhayāt\",\"translation\":\"danger\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":746,\"bb\":672,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/2/40/b672/\",\"body_value\":\"In this endeavor there is no loss or diminution, and a little advancement on this path can protect one from the most dangerous type of fear.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":747,\"bb\":673,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/2/40/b673/\",\"body_value\":\"$25\"},{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":748,\"bb\":674,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/2/40/b674/\",\"body_value\":\"tyaktvā sva-dharmaṁ caraṇāmbujaṁ harer
bhajann apakvo ’tha patet tato yadi
yatra kva vābhadram abhūd amuṣya kiṁ
ko vārtha āpto ’bhajatāṁ sva-dharmataḥ\"},{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":749,\"bb\":675,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/2/40/b675/\",\"body_value\":\"“If someone gives up his occupational duties and works in Kṛṣṇa consciousness and then falls down on account of not completing his work, what loss is there on his part? And what can one gain if one performs his material activities perfectly?” Or, as the Christians say, “What profiteth a man if he gain the whole world yet suffer the loss of his eternal soul?”\"},{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":750,\"bb\":676,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/2/40/b676/\",\"body_value\":\"Material activities and their results end with the body. But work in Kṛṣṇa consciousness carries a person again to Kṛṣṇa consciousness, even after the loss of the body. At least one is sure to have a chance in the next life of being born again as a human being, either in the family of a great cultured brāhmaṇa or in a rich aristocratic family that will give one a further chance for elevation. That is the unique quality of work done in Kṛṣṇa consciousness.\"}]}],\"short_title\":\"Bg. 2.40\",\"medium_title\":\"Bhagavad-gītā As It Is 2.40\"},\"locale\":\"en\",\"activeView\":\"$6:props:activeView\"}]}],\"$L26\",\"$L27\",\"$L28\"]}]\n"])self.__next_f.push([1,"2a:I[83068,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n30:I[78455,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a